<title>USA: Texaco sees Sept. outage at Calif. refinery.</title>
<headline>Texaco sees Sept. outage at Calif. refinery.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc plans to shut a gasoline-making unit later this week at its 60,000 barrel-per-day refinery in Bakersfield, Calif., a spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Operators will shut the 17,500 bpd hydrocracker for two weeks to conduct regularly scheduled maintenance.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not anticipate any supply disruption,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>--David Brinkerhoff, Los Angeles bureau +1 213 380 2014</p>
